/fplblackbox      \n\nWe greatly appreciate all SuperChats as a way of supporting the stream! We will do our best to answer these at the end of the stream\n----------------------------------------------\nFollow us:\n\n🅾 INSTAGRAM: www.instagram.com/FPLBlackBox\n\n💻 DISCORD:     / discord  \n\n🐦X: https://www.x.com/fplblackbox\n-----------------------------------------------\n#FPLBlackBox #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #premierleague #GW1 Fantasy Football Scout, Fantasy Football Tips, Fantasy Football Gameweek 1 GW 1\n-----------------------------------------------\nContact us: \n\n📧 Az@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Andy@fplblackbox.com","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":470,"length":30,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COUBEM2rARgBIhMI-9yhhfOrlgMVxsXSBB2X1hjWSJrO56nbhbiPf8oBBDw6UzY=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUlJFUlptQUx2b2ZPSC0yX3JILVNWYXxBR3JiS2FuZWJRNU0wZkRLZl9hZVJrMHo0ay1RT0tvRzFUcjBiLTNFOVFZeHpzN2V3R3k0TXRUMUpaWDA5UkRRbWhHWEVmOVVTWXkyN2dqV2luNDRrLVZzanVvTENDb3JBSDBx\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=fx7gLbU55xo","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUlJFUlptQUx2b2ZPSC0yX3JILVNWYXxBR3JiS2FuZWJRNU0wZkRLZl9hZVJrMHo0ay1RT0tvRzFUcjBiLTNFOVFZeHpzN2V3R3k0TXRUMUpaWDA5UkRRbWhHWEVmOVVTWXkyN2dqV2luNDRrLVZzanVvTENDb3JBSDBx\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=fx7gLbU55xo","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":618,"length":22,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"COUBEM2rARgBIhMI-9yhhfOrlgMVxsXSBB2X1hjWSJrO56nbhbiPf8oBBDw6UzY=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUm12MDJfVVJLZnVUM2F0WWY2dTcydnxBR3JiS2FtQTVZWDZMaTRxLWpXM2ExOThJWWFHVVhidFR0ek1WNThKUEpKQ09Eaks1QkxJSFRfbmwtcWJVTjd4dkxYazViX3IxU